Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
User fresteinart@gmail.com
PassCmd "gopass show -o email_services/isync/accounts.google.com/fresteinart@gmail.com"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/Documents/mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/Documents/mail/gmail/inbox

Channel gmail-inbox
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns "INBOX"

Channel gmail-starred
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/Starred"
Near :gmail-local:starred

Channel gmail-important
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/Important"
Near :gmail-local:important

Channel gmail-sent
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/Sent Mail"
Near :gmail-local:sent

Channel gmail-drafts
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/Drafts"
Near :gmail-local:drafts

Channel gmail-all
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/All Mail"
Near :gmail-local:all

Channel gmail-spam
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/Spam"
Near :gmail-local:spam

Channel gmail-trash
Far :gmail-remote:"[Gmail]/Trash"
Near :gmail-local:trash

Group gmail
Channel gmail-inbox
Channel gmail-starred
Channel gmail-important
Channel gmail-sent
Channel gmail-drafts
Channel gmail-all
Channel gmail-spam
Channel gmail-trash
